          <p>The Center for Nurturing Future Leaders (CNFL) is a pioneering initiative by the Piramal School of Leadership committed to identifying the critical learning needs of youth and women and designing learning processes and experiences rooted in adult learning principles.</p>
          <p>Rather than offering generic training models, CNFL creates <b>customized leadership development pathways</b> in the form of a Fellowship that unlock untapped potential and prepare fellows to take on impact-driven roles in nation-building. Our approach goes beyond capacity building – it nurtures inner transformation, contextual decision-making, and systems thinking among emerging leaders.</p>
